(a) Any special features or characteristics which
                    render it readily convertible:— 
                        (i)

for amphibious assault operations;
                        (ii)

to an aircraft carrier or for operating aircraft;
                        (iii)

to a repair or depot ship for submarines, aircraft or coastal forces
                            craft;
                        (iv)

to a fighter direction vessel;
                        (v)

to any other combatant or naval auxiliary type of vessel.
